# {{projectName}}

{{description}}

Built with pasha CLI — **Vertical Slice** architecture on Django.

## Stack

{{#if hasOrm}}- **ORM:** Django ORM{{/if}}
{{#if ormNone}}- **Data layer:** in-memory repositories{{/if}}
{{#if hasDatabase}}- **Database:** {{database}}{{/if}}
{{#if hasValidation}}- **Validation:** Pydantic + DRF serializers{{/if}}
{{#if useRedis}}- **Cache:** Redis{{/if}}
{{#if hasBroker}}- **Messaging:** {{broker}}{{/if}}

## Run

```bash
# set up virtual environment
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate

pip install -r requirements.txt
{{#if devRequirementsTxt}}
pip install -r dev-requirements.txt
{{/if}}

cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d       # start databases/brokers
{{/if}}
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver
```

## Modules

{{#each modules}}
- `{{snakeCase this}}` → `http://localhost:8000/{{this}}`
